 of the pine tree was shiny and dark.","audioSeconds":3.05,"runSeconds":0.1706995,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.17066918,"realTimeFactor":0.055967049180327876,"finite":true,"samples":73200},{"index":111,"text":"Leaves turn brown and yellow in the fall.","audioSeconds":2.775,"runSeconds":0.156579618,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.156547307,"realTimeFactor":0.05642508756756757,"finite":true,"samples":66600},{"index":112,"text":"The pennant waved when the wind blew.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.135378104,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.135357673,"realTimeFactor":0.05582602226804124,"finite":true,"samples":58200},{"index":113,"text":"Split the log with a quick, sharp blow.","audioSeconds":2.725,"runSeconds":0.149290364,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.149266174,"realTimeFactor":0.05478545467889909,"finite":true,"samples":65400},{"index":114,"text":"Burn peat after the logs give out.","audioSeconds":2.575,"runSeconds":0.172632257,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.172610427,"realTimeFactor":0.0670416532038835,"finite":true,"samples":61800},{"index":115,"text":"He ordered peach pie with ice cream.","audioSeconds":2.5,"runSeconds":0.139043646,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.139020825,"realTimeFactor":0.0556174584,"finite":true,"samples":60000},{"index":116,"text":"Weave the carpet on the right hand side.","audioSeconds":2.55,"runSeconds":0.143518125,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.143496615,"realTimeFactor":0.05628161764705883,"finite":true,"samples":61200},{"index":117,"text":"Hemp is a weed found in parts of the tropics.","audioSeconds":3.1,"runSeconds":0.171413587,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.171387497,"realTimeFactor":0.05529470548387097,"finite":true,"samples":74400},{"index":118,"text":"A lame back kept his score low.","audioSeconds":2.425,"runSeconds":0.133991992,"g2pSeconds":0.0,"timeToFirstAudioSeconds":0.133971361,"realTimeFactor":0.055254429690721654